.Sh SELECTED WORKER NAMESPACES
When the supervisor supplies a selected namespace view, the worker uses only
that view and closes inherited broad namespace parents.
A missing selected entry does not cause fallback to a broader parent.
A selected worker cannot replace its session through
.Dv BSDFILESYSTEM_OP_BEGIN_SESSION ;
a new session requires a new supervised selection.
